OL,3,GNEWSAData centre proposed for Charlton
OL,4,Aindustrial sites
OL,5,
OL,6,FA data centre has been proposed for
OL,7,Fsouth-east London, weeks after plans
OL,8,Ffor thousands of homes were announced
OL,9,Ffor the area.
OL,11,FReal estate business Tyburn RWC Limited
OL,12,Fwants to build a 100,000 sq m data
OL,13,Fdevelopment on industrial land at
OL,14,FCharlton Riverside between the River
OL,15,FThames and Woolwich Road.
OL,17,FIt follows the announcement of a
OL,18,Fpartnership between Greenwich Council,
OL,19,FTransport for London and the mayor's
OL,20,Foffice, which hopes to bring 8,000
OL,21,Fhomes and 1,000 jobs to the area in the
OL,22,Fnext 20 years.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
