OL,3,GNEWSAData centre proposed for Charlton
OL,4,Aindustrial sites
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe data centre plans clash with a
OL,7,Fproposal to open a 5,000-capacity
OL,8,Foutdoor events venue on the same
OL,9,Findustrial estate, which had received
OL,10,Fcriticism from police and Greenwich
OL,11,FCouncil teams.
